[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2605.11801, 'A non-local singular non-linear Fokker-Planck PDE'] Let $\g\in(0,1)$ and Assumptions \ref{ass:K} and \ref{ass:F} hold. Let also $f,g\in \shc^\gamma\cap L^1$. Then we have 
