body:
[Theorem 14 of arXiv:2608.21905, '\bf Ruin theory incorporating MIPP-type jumps'] With $\hat{R}_n$ as introduced in Theorem \ref{th63}, the process
\begin{equation*}
\begin{split}
 \exp\left\{-\hat{R}_n\left(ct-\sum_{i=0}^{V_t^{(n)}}\xi_i\right)\right\}
\end{split}
\end{equation*}
forms a martingale. Moreover, the following inequality holds:
\begin{equation*}
\begin{split}
 \Pi_n(x)\le e^{-\hat{R}_n x}.
\end{split}
\end{equation*}

