body:
[Lem l.isom.consistent of arXiv:2507.16056, 'Conditional GMC within the stochastic heat flow'] Take any internally disjoint $I_1, \ldots, I_k\in\mathbb{I}$ whose union gives an interval, and, for each $i=1,\ldots,k$, take internally disjoint $I_{i1},\ldots,I_{i n_j}\in\mathbb{I}$ whose union gives $I_i$.
We have
\begin{align}
	O_{\mathrm{all}\, I_{ij}\mathrm{s}} 
	= 
	\big( 
		O_{I_{11} \ldots I_{1 n_1}} \oplus \cdots \oplus O_{I_{k 1} \ldots I_{k n_k}}
	\big)
	\,
	O_{I_{1} \ldots I_{k}}\ .
\end{align}

