body:
[Lemma lem:q of arXiv:2607.21443, 'The critical KPZ scale for the averaging process'] For every $\varepsilon\in(0,1)$,
	there exists $C_\varepsilon>0$ satisfying
	\begin{equation}
		\int_0^\infty e^{-\rho t}h_{\lambda,N}(t)\,{\rm d} t
		\le
	\frac{1+\varepsilon}2
		+
		C_\varepsilon\frac{N^{4(\lambda-7/8)}}{\sqrt \rho}\; \text{,}\;\;
	\end{equation}
 for all $\lambda\le 7/8$, $\rho>0$, and $N$ large enough.

