		m_n(S) \coloneqq {\mathbb E}\big[\hat{\mu}_n^M(S)\big] = \frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^n {\mathbb P}[M_i^n\in S],\qquad S \in \mathcal{B}({\mathcal C}).
