\item For any $\varepsilon >0$ and $c>0$, 
there exist $\delta >0$ and $N_0 \in {\mathbb N}$, such that, for all $N \geq N_0$ and every $k \in {\mathbb Z}$ with $|k| \le \delta N$,
\begin{equation}

