[Dfn $L^r$-optimal quantization error of arXiv:2506.01746, '\bf Optimal Bregman quantization: existence and uniqueness of optimal quantizers revisited'] The  $L^r$-optimal mean quantization error for $P$ at level $n\ge 1$ is defined by 
\begin{equation*}
    e_{r,n}(P,\|.\|) = \inf_{\Gamma: |\Gamma|\leq n}  e_r(\Gamma,P,\|.\|).
\end{equation*}

