body:
[Lemma lem:Power4 of arXiv:2606.19313, 'Stability of Khintchine-type inequalities via log-monotonicity'] Let $a=(a_1, a_2, \ldots, a_n)\in \mathbb{R}^n$ satisfy $\sum_ka_k^2=1$. For each integer $q\geq 2$, 
\begin{align*}
q!\sum_{\ell(\alpha)<q} \prod_i \frac{a_i^{2\alpha_i}}{\alpha_i!}\geq \Delta_q(a), 
\end{align*}in which
\begin{align*}
0\leq \Delta_q(a)=\begin{cases} 1 & n<q,\\
1-q!\binom{n}{q}\Big( \frac{1-\sum_ka_k^4}{n(n-1)}\Big)^{\frac{q}{2}}& n\geq q.
\end{cases}
\end{align*}

