        \limsup\limits_{T \to +\infty} \exp(\lambda_1 T)\chi^2(\mu_{T/2}^{T}||\diffref) &\leq 2(K^2+1)\sum_{i\in \mathcal{I}_1} (p_i^2 + q_i^2),
