where $\rho_k\coloneqq\mathbb{P}(X^{(k)}_1>0)$ is the positivity parameter of $X^{(k)}$ from the description in  (\ref{item_a}). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

[Proposition 12 of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] For any $\ph\in\cL_0$ and $\psi\in\cL_1$, one has the relations 
\begin{align}
 \Lambda(\psi^{-1})(t) &= \bigbrak{\Lambda(\psi)(t)}^{-1}\;, \\
 \Lambda(\exp_\ast\ph)(t) &= \exp(\Lambda(\ph)(t))\;, \\
 \Lambda(\log_\ast\psi)(t) &= \log(\Lambda(\psi)(t))\;.

\end{align}

